### Create order

POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111119",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222229",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 19.99
    },
    {
      "productId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333339",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 49.99
    }
  ]
}


### Get order
@orderId = cf5a6f1b-6b0b-4d8c-a831-1f78bd47484b

GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{orderId}}